      "reasoning": "Wait — they blocked! Even though their creatures appeared tapped? Let me reconsider...\n\
\n\
- **Dwynen's Elite** (2/2) blocked by **Scion Summoner** (2/2) — both die in combat\n\
- **Elderleaf Mentor** (3/2) blocked by **Ornery Dilophosaur** (2/2 deathtouch) — Mentor kills Dilo but Mentor dies to deathtouch\n\
- **Elf Warrior Token** (1/1) blocked by **Eldrazi Scion Token** (1/1) — both die\n\
- **Primeval Herald** (3/1) — UNBLOCKED! 3 damage gets through\n\
\n\
So only 3 damage gets through. They go to 3. I lose Elite, Mentor, and Token. They lose all 3 blockers. \n\
\n\
But wait — I have Titanic Growth! Should I use it? Let me think...\n\
\n\
If I pump Herald (+4/+4 = 7/5 trample), it's unblocked so it deals 7. That's overkill but wastes the Growth. \n\
\n\
What about pumping Elderleaf Mentor? It's blocked by the 2/2 deathtouch Dilophosaur. Even if I pump it to 7/6, deathtouch still kills it. No trample either, so no extra damage goes through. Bad.\n\
\n\
What about pumping Dwynen's Elite? Blocked by 2/2 Scion Summoner. Pump to 6/6, kills the 2/2, but no trample — 0 extra damage. But Elite survives! That's decent.\n\
\n\
Actually, the best play: pump Primeval Herald with Titanic Growth. It's unblocked. 7 damage to face instead of 3. They go to -1. That's lethal!\n\
\n\
Wait, 3 unblocked + Titanic Growth (+4) = 7 total from Herald alone. They're at 6. 7 > 6. LETHAL!",
